{"data":{"uuid":"934ac478-9c87-48d1-8fd3-e5359171983c","slug":"atlas","name":"Atlas","class_name":"QDRV_RSI_S01_Atlas_SCItem","classification":"Ship.QuantumDrive","classification_label":"Quantum Drive","description":{"en_EN":"Though it may seem commonplace today, Humanity's ability to travel across solar systems at quantum speeds was built upon a foundation of Roberts Space Industries' technology and craftsmanship. Now, space travel has reached even higher heights thanks to the top-of-class performance of RSI's Atlas pushing quantum drive technology farther than it's ever gone.","de_DE":"Hersteller: RSI\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S1\nG\u00fctegrad: A\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nObwohl es heute allt\u00e4glich erscheinen mag, basiert die F\u00e4higkeit der Menschheit, mit Quantum-Geschwindigkeit durch Sonnensysteme zu reisen, auf einer Grundlage von Roberts Technologie und Handwerkskunst von Space Industries. Jetzt hat die Raumfahrt dank der erstklassigen Leistung von RSIs Atlas sogar noch h\u00f6here H\u00f6hen erreicht und die Quantenantriebs-Technologie weiter vorangetrieben als je zuvor.","zh_CN":"\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u7f57\u4f2f\u8328\u592a\u7a7a\u5de5\u4e1a\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a1\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aA\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u5c3d\u7ba1\u5982\u4eca\u770b\u6765\u53f8\u7a7a\u89c1\u60ef\uff0c\u4f46\u4eba\u7c7b\u6700\u65e9\u5728\u592a\u9633\u7cfb\u91cf\u5b50\u822a\u884c\u7684\u80fd\u529b\u662f\u5efa\u7acb\u5728\u7f57\u4f2f\u8328\u592a\u7a7a\u5de5\u4e1a\u516c\u53f8\u7684\u6280\u672f\u548c\u5de5\u827a\u57fa\u7840\u4e0a\u7684\u3002\u73b0\u5728\uff0c\u5f97\u76ca\u4e8e\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u6280\u672f\u5f97\u5230\u4e86\u6df1\u8fdc\u7684\u53d1\u5c55\uff0c\u7f57\u4f2f\u8328\u592a\u7a7a\u5de5\u4e1a\u7684 \"\u64ce\u5929\u4e4b\u795e\"\u4ee5\u5176\u4e00\u6d41\u7684\u6027\u80fd\u6807\u5fd7\u7740\u592a\u7a7a\u65c5\u884c\u5df2\u7ecf\u8fbe\u5230\u4e86\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u9ad8\u5ea6\u3002","fr_FR":"Type d'article : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : RSI\nTaille : 1\nQualit\u00e9 : A\nClasse : Civil\n\nBien qu'elle puisse sembler banale aujourd'hui, la capacit\u00e9 de l'humanit\u00e9 \u00e0 voyager \u00e0 travers les syst\u00e8mes solaires \u00e0 des vitesses quantiques repose sur une fondation de la technologie et du savoir-faire de Roberts Space Industries. D\u00e9sormais, les voyages spatiaux ont atteint des sommets encore plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s gr\u00e2ce aux performances de pointe de l'Atlas de RSI, repoussant la technologie des propulseurs quantiques plus loin qu'elle n'est jamais all\u00e9e."},"size":1,"mass":210,"event_source":[],"is_base_variant":true,"is_craftable":true,"is_lootable":false,"blueprint":[{"uuid":"17b29a33-88fe-484f-bb9b-fbf780273ff5","name":"Atlas","link":"https:\/\/api.star-citizen.wiki\/api\/blueprints\/17b29a33-88fe-484f-bb9b-fbf780273ff5"}],"grade":"A","class":"Civilian","description_data":[{"name":"Class","value":"Civilian","type":"Civilian"},{"name":"Grade","value":"A","type":"A"},{"name":"Item Type","value":"Quantum Drive","type":"Quantum Drive"},{"name":"Manufacturer","value":"Roberts Space Industries","type":"Roberts Space Industries"},{"name":"Size","value":"1","type":"1"}],"manufacturer_description":"Roberts Space Industries","manufacturer":{"name":"Roberts Space Industries","code":"RSI","uuid":"093e6eba-93fa-4dad-b3dd-38966934e34e","link":"https:\/\/api.star-citizen.wiki\/api\/manufacturers\/RSI"},"type":"QuantumDrive","type_label":"Quantum Drive","type_web_url":"https:\/\/api.star-citizen.wiki\/items?filter%5Btype%5D=QuantumDrive","sub_type":"UNDEFINED","sub_type_label":"Undefined","quantum_drive":{"quantum_fuel_requirement":0.007546,"jump_range":3.402823e+38,"jump_range_formatted":"Unlimited","disconnect_range":19248,"disconnect_range_formatted":"19 km","fuel_rate":7.546e-9,"thermal_energy_draw":{"pre_ramp_up":735,"ramp_up":735,"in_flight":735,"ramp_down":735,"post_ramp_down":735